E. FUNCTIONALITY
-------------------------------------------------------------

19. Link sharing needs to be reworked (P1)
    Issues:
    - After clicking one county and then choosing another from the dropdown, the link still points to the first county.
    - The zoom extent is not kept in shared links, depending on the layer.
    - Filtering to a geography without selecting it creates a link that opens the tab with "No Assembly District Selected."
    Action: The shared link should always reflect the current geography tab, the selected area and the map extent.
    Done when: Opening a shared link shows exactly the same view as when it was shared, on all three geography tabs.

20. Download and print (P1)
    Issue: The download button and the Print widget do not work.
    Action: Replace them with one export option based on a print layout that includes the map, the program table for the selected area and the methodology note. Offer PDF and PNG.

21. Header graphic (P1)
    Action: Fix the broken header image link and replace the generic placeholder logo with the CPUC logo (CPUC will provide the file).

